          "feedback2": "The response is perfectly helpful. It accurately addresses the prompt with the matched enthusiasm that the user includes. The model lets the user know that it's happy to hear about what they are working on. Also, the response is happy to provide support and feedback. The response cannot be meaningfully improved."
